O\"}}":{"__typename":"Shelving","creator":{"__ref":"User:kca://profile:goodreads/A3GSTV3N7AZYH4","id":"kca://profile:goodreads/A3GSTV3N7AZYH4"},"book":{"__ref":"Book:kca://book/amzn1.gr.book.v3.2_I5zYjOxTLO1_6O","id":"kca://book/amzn1.gr.book.v3.2_I5zYjOxTLO1_6O"},"shelf":{"__typename":"Shelf","name":"read","displayName":"Read","editable":false,"default":true,"actionType":"add_to_read","sortOrder":2,"webUrl":"https://www.goodreads.com/review/list/53982134?shelf=read"},"taggings":[{"__typename":"Tagging","tag":{"__typename":"Tag","name":"enemies-to-lovers","webUrl":"https://www.goodreads.com/review/list/53982134?shelf=enemies-to-lovers"}},{"__typename":"Tagging","tag":{"__typename":"Tag","name":"fantasy","webUrl":"https://www.goodreads.com/review/list/53982134?shelf=fantasy"}},{"__typename":"Tagging","tag":{"__typename":"Tag","name":"favorites","webUrl":"https://www.goodreads.com/review/list/53982134?shelf=favorites"}}],"webUrl":"https://www.goodreads.com/review/show/3638760170"},"Review:kca://review:goodreads/amzn1.gr.review:goodreads.v1.4omoUrFudcPRZ7jxi-kDsA":{"__typename":"Review","id":"kca://review:goodreads/amzn1.gr.review:goodreads.v1.4omoUrFudcPRZ7jxi-kDsA","creator":{"__ref":"User:53982134"},"recommendFor":null,"updatedAt":1773307284483,"createdAt":1662230319021,"spoilerStatus":false,"lastRevisionAt":1673406854706,"text":"\u003ci\u003e“Awake or asleep, all I see is your face. All I hear is your voice. All I feel is you in my arms. All I want is you.”\u003c/i\u003e\u003cbr /\u003e\u003cbr /\u003eI loved this book so much! This was a fantastic and action-packed fantasy romance about love, betrayal, revenge and the cost of power. The Traitor Queen follows Lara as she goes on a journey of hardship and love to save Aren. Along the way she meets new enemies and allies and learns more about herself. \u003cbr /\u003e\u003cbr /\u003eThis book is told from Lara and Aren's point of view. I was swept up in this brilliant world that the author created from the very beginning. The world building is amazing! This book has everything I wanted in fantasy romance including political intrigue, amazing characters, enemies to lovers romance, slow-burn and awesome chemistry between the two main characters. The pacing was perfect and the plot was exciting from the beginning till the end. The characters in the book were complex and interesting. My favorite character is Lara, she is fierce, badass, resilient, tenacious, brave, and caring towards the people she loves. I loved Lara's character development in this book, she grew so much and showed that she will do whatever it takes to protect Aren and Ithicana. I love Aren so much, he is handsome, brave, sweet, kind, charming, and strong. I really liked the new characters we were introduced to especially Lara's sisters and Zarrah. The chemistry between Lara and Aren was amazing and I loved their relationship. The spice was SO good!! The author is an excellent writer, the descriptive writing allowed me to vividly picture everything in my head. The ending was so great! I recommend this book to anyone who loves fantasy, romance, enemies-to-lovers romance and excellent characters.","rating":5,"preReleaseBookSource":null,"shelving":{"__ref":"Shelving:{\"creator\":{\"id\":\"kca://profile:goodreads/A3GSTV3N7AZYH4\"},\"book\":{\"id\":\"kca://book/amzn1.gr.book.v3.2_I5zYjOxTLO1_6O\"}}"},"likeCount":150,"viewerHasLiked":null,"commentCount":36},"User:84801697":{"__typename":"User","legacyId":84801697,"imageUrlSquare":"https://i.gr-assets.com/images/S/compressed.photo.goodreads.com/users/1646081976i/84801697._UY200_CR35,0,200,200_.jpg","isAuthor":false,"viewerRelationshipStatus":null,"followersCount":3805,"textReviewsCount":1388,"name":"Lucie V.","webUrl":"https://www.goodreads.com/user/show/84801697-lucie-v","contributor":null,"id":84801697},"User:kca://profile:goodreads/ADJY0EK94H1RO":{"__typename":"User","id":"kca://profile:goodreads/ADJY0EK94H1RO"},"Shelving:{\"creator\":{\"id\":\"kca://profile:goodreads/ADJY0EK94H1RO\"},\"book\":{\"id\":\"kca://book/amzn1.gr.book.v3.ADb8gezEL7SuqGme\"}}":{"__typename":"Shelving","creator":{"__ref":"User:kca://profile:goodreads/ADJY0EK94H1RO","id":"kca://profile:goodreads/ADJY0EK94H1RO"},"book":{"__ref":"Book:kca://book/amzn1.gr.book.v3.ADb8gezEL7SuqGme","id":"kca://book/amzn1.gr.book.v3.ADb8gezEL7SuqGme"},"shelf":{"__typename":"Shelf","name":"read","displayName":"Read","editable":false,"default":true,"actionType":"add_to_read","sortOrder":2,"webUrl":"https://www.goodreads.com/review/list/84801697?shelf=read"},"taggings":[{"__typename":"Tagging","tag":{"__typename":"Tag","name":"fantasy","webUrl":"https://www.goodreads.com/review/list/84801697?shelf=fantasy"}},{"__typename":"Tagging","tag":{"__typename":"Tag","name":"favorites","webUrl":"https://www.goodreads.com/review/list/84801697?shelf=favorites"}},{"__typename":"Tagging","tag":{"__typename":"Tag","name":"hate-to-love","webUrl":"https://www.goodreads.com/review/list/84801697?shelf=hate-to-love"}},{"__typename":"Tagging","tag":{"__typename":"Tag","name":"arranged-marriage","webUrl":"https://www.goodreads.com/review/list/84801697?shelf=arranged-marriage"}}],"webUrl":"https://www.goodreads.com/review/show/3475481063"},"Review:kca://review:goodreads/amzn1.gr.review:goodreads.v1.t9ssc2ByGC28b5JgDV0vpQ":{"__typename":"Review","id":"kca://review:goodreads/amzn1.gr.review:goodreads.v1.t9ssc2ByGC28b5JgDV0vpQ","creator":{"__ref":"User:84801697"},"recommendFor":null,"updatedAt":1778793425474,"createdAt":1603679557276,"spoilerStatus":false,"lastRevisionAt":1776693693025,"text":"✅ Angsty\u003cbr /\u003e✅ “I hate that I still love you”\u003cbr /\u003e✅ Badass and ruthless main character \u003cbr /\u003e✅ Romance\u003cbr /\u003e✅ Pace and plot\u003cbr /\u003e✅ Action and fighting \u003cbr /\u003e✅ World-building\u003cbr /\u003e✅ Scheming and life-threatening situations\u003cbr /\u003e✅ Plot twists \u003cbr /\u003e✅ New characters\u003cbr /\u003e❗️❗️Trigger warnings: mentions of past abuse and sexual assault (not graphic), mild torture, deaths, and shark eating enemies\u003cbr /\u003e🔥 Spice level : 🌶️🌶️🌶️ / 5\u003cbr /\u003e\u003cbr /\u003e_______________________ \u003cbr /\u003e\u003cbr /\u003e\u003cb\u003eSecond read:\u003c/b\u003e Still amazing. \u003cbr /\u003eThe audiobook is great. \u003cbr /\u003eThe angst is great. \u003cbr /\u003eI love Lara and Aren.\u003cbr /\u003eThey both kick asses.\u003cbr /\u003eThe end.\u003cbr /\u003e\u003cbr /\u003e_______________________ \u003cbr /\u003e\u003cbr /\u003e\u003cbr /\u003e\u003cblockquote\u003e\n  \u003cb\u003e\n    \u003ci\u003e “Trusting you was my mistake. Loving you was my mistake.” \u003c/i\u003e\n  \u003c/b\u003e\n\u003c/blockquote\u003e\u003cbr /\u003e\u003cbr /\u003e\u003cb\u003eWhat an amazing book! What a wild ride! I couldn't put it down! \u003c/b\u003e❤️\u003cbr /\u003e\u003cbr /\u003eThe Traitor Queen picks up a few months after the end of \u003ca href=\"https://goodreads.com/book/show/43383182.The_Bridge_Kingdom__The_Bridge_Kingdom___1_\" title=\"The Bridge Kingdom (The Bridge Kingdom, #1) by Danielle L. Jensen\" rel=\"noopener\"\u003eThe Bridge Kingdom\u003c/a\u003e. Lara made some big mistakes in the first book, and now she is trying to make up for them and find a way to redeem herself. \u003cbr /\u003e\u003cbr /\u003e\u003cblockquote\u003e\n  \u003cb\u003e\n    \u003ci\u003eShe was the traitor queen. The reason Ithicana lost the bridge. The reason hundreds, if not thousands, of Ithicanians had perished.\u003c/i\u003e\n  \u003c/b\u003e\n\u003c/blockquote\u003e\u003cbr /\u003e\u003cbr /\u003e\u003cb\u003eI loved all this book's love/hate and angst. \u003c/b\u003eThat, coupled with all the action, kept me on the edge of my seat. I felt like crying for Lara at times, and I was so frustrated by how she was treated (but at the same time, I understand why they all hate her), but I enjoyed reading this book so much because of all these emotions and the angst.\u003cbr /\u003e\u003cbr /\u003e\u003cblockquote\u003e\n  \u003cb\u003e\n    \u003ci\u003e“Forgive her. She loves you.” He dropped the old woman’s arm, feeling Lara’s gaze on him. Knowing she was listening.\u003cbr /\u003e“She doesn’t know what love is.”\u003cbr /\u003e“That’s why you should forgive her.”\u003c/i\u003e\n  \u003c/b\u003e\n\u003c/blockquote\u003e\u003cbr /\u003e\u003cbr /\u003e\u003cb\u003eThe plot and the pace are great, and it was very easy to get absorbed into this adventure. \u003c/b\u003eThere is still a political aspect woven into the book, but it’s more about war and fighting rather than spying. The relationship aspect also takes a lot of room with Aren trying, but failing, to hate Lara, and Lara hating herself and trying to right her wrongs. The descriptions were slightly less atmospheric than in the first one, because Lara and Aren had to travel a lot, and could not spend long in one place, but at the same time, the world-building expanded, and we got to discover new places, which is always nice.\u003cbr /\u003e\u003cbr /\u003e\u003cblockquote\u003e\n  \u003cb\u003e\n    \u003ci\u003e\"There's no one in the world like you, you know.\"\u003cbr /\u003e\"No, there isn't.\" \u003cbr /\u003e\"Because there is only one Queen of Ithicana. Just as there is only one King. And if any of our enemies dare come for our kingdom, we will bring them to their knees.\"\u003c/i\u003e\n  \u003c/b\u003e\n\u003c/blockquote\u003e\u003cbr /\u003e\u003cbr /\u003e\u003cb\u003eThere is a lot of action in this book! Nerve-wracking and heart-pounding moments.\u003c/b\u003e Lara is still a badass, and Aren shows us again how determined and fierce he is when comes time to defend his country and his people. I missed the banter that we had in the first book, but the action and the pace of this book are so intense that it makes up for it! I couldn't put it down both times I read it. One thing that I disliked a tiny little bit is the constant time jumps in the first half of the book. What feels like a few days are weeks, and what feels like weeks are months. \u003cinput type=\"checkbox\" class=\"spoiler__control\" aria-label=\"The following text has been marked spoiler. Toggle checkbox to reveal or hide.\" onchange=\"this.labels[0].setAttribute('aria-hidden', !this.checked);\" id=\"d20ebd03-882a-4143-b478-5e1366a6fe35\" /\u003e\u003clabel aria-hidden=\"true\" class=\"spoiler\" for=\"d20ebd03-882a-4143-b478-5e1366a6fe35\"\u003eFor example, I had the feeling that Aren spent a few weeks in captivity, but he spent months being a prisoner. The traveling in the desert part also feels like it happens in a few days, but it takes them weeks to reach their destination. I would have liked to have more character development during these long months of captivity or these long weeks together in the desert.\u003c/label\u003e\u003cbr /\u003e\u003cbr /\u003e\u003cblockquote\u003e\n  \u003cb\u003e\n    \u003ci\u003eShe was right, and he knew it. But in his heart, he knew that even if he never saw her again for the rest of his life, it would never be over.\u003cbr /\u003eShe would always be his queen.\u003c/i\u003e\n  \u003c/b\u003e\n\u003c/blockquote\u003e\u003cbr /\u003e\u003cbr /\u003e\u003cb\u003eAren, while being amazing (and gorgeous), annoyed me a little in this book.\u003c/b\u003e I understand why he feels the way he does, I really do, but the fact that when he is asked to choose between his country and his queen, he is SO indecisive made me so frustrated at times! There are also a few times when he was asked to make a tough choice, and he just refused, which made it look like he just wanted to please everyone and hold on to his moral standards, while also being in life-threatening situations and having to fight a war. A part of me also wanted to slap him for the way he treated Lara (even though she kind of deserved a part of it), but the angst-lover part of me was SO HAPPY! But even though he was a little annoying at times, I still love him with all my heart, and he is still great in this book. \u003cbr /\u003e\u003cbr /\u003e\u003cblockquote\u003e\n  \u003cb\u003e\n    \u003ci\u003e“You are my goddamned damnation, but there will never be anyone but you.”\u003c/i\u003e\n  \u003c/b\u003e\n\u003c/blockquote\u003e\u003cbr /\u003e\u003cbr /\u003e\u003cb\u003eLara is still feisty and driven, but she is also full of self-loathing in this book. \u003c/b\u003eShe wants to redeem herself, but she has a lot of work to do. She knows she cannot hope or ask for forgiveness, but she wants to atone and free Ithicana before leaving and spending the rest of her life hidden somewhere. Being a sucker for hate-to-love romance, I was so happy to be able to have that dynamic a second time for Lara and Aren. While they are still officially married, the trust between them is broken, and they need to rebuild everything between them from scratch. There are some cute and intense moments in this book, too, and they are, without a doubt, one of my favorite fantasy couples.\u003cbr /\u003e\u003cbr /\u003e\u003cb\u003eI adore the new characters we meet in this book! \u003c/b\u003eLara's sisters were great, and I hope to see more of them in the next books. It is nice to see how they helped and protected each other despite everything that happened between them. I also like Keris very much, and I hope that he will not break my heart... I want to like him and trust him, but I am afraid to be disappointed with him in the next book.\u003cbr /\u003e\u003cbr /\u003e\u003cb\u003eThe ending is good and sweet, but I was hoping for something a little more meaningful and intense, maybe.\u003c/b\u003e There is no cliffhanger like in the first book since this is the end of Lara and Arren's adventure, and the next book will be about Keris and Zarrah. Lara and Aren were awesome, and I am definitely going to re-read this series in the years to come because I am utterly in love with them, but I am also very excited to read the next book because I know that Keris has the potential to steal the show and my heart too. \u003cbr /\u003e\u003cbr /\u003e\u003cbr /\u003e1. \u003ca href=\"https://www.goodreads.com/review/show/3092085305\" rel=\"nofollow noopener\"\u003eThe Bridge Kingdom\u003c/a\u003e ⭐⭐⭐⭐⭐\u003cbr /\u003e\u003cbr /\u003e\u003cbr /\u003e\u003ca href=\"https://www.instagram.com/lucie_v_booklover/\" rel=\"nofollow noopener\"\u003eFollow me on Instagram\u003c/a\u003e 🙂","rating":5,"preReleaseBookSource":null,"shelving":{"__ref":"Shelving:{\"creator\":{\"id\":\"kca://profile:goodreads/ADJY0EK94H1RO\"},\"book\":{\"id\":\"kca://book/amzn1.gr.book.v3.ADb8gezEL7SuqGme\"}}"},"likeCount":144,"viewerHasLiked":null,"commentCount":18},"User:142072672":{"__typename":"User","legacyId":142072672,"imageUrlSquare":"https://i.gr-assets.com/images/S/compressed.photo.goodreads.com/users/1771305547i/142072672._UX200_CR0,0,200,200_.jpg","isAuthor":false,"viewerRelationshipStatus":null,"followersCount":13007,"textReviewsCount":644,"name":"SK ","webUrl":"https://www.goodreads.com/user/show/142072672-sk","contributor":null,"id":142072672},"User:kca://profile:goodreads/A3654WU95SBAAX":{"__typename":"User","id":"kca://profile:goodreads/A3654WU95SBAAX"},"Shelving:{\"creator\":{\"id\":\"kca://profile:goodreads/A3654WU95SBAAX\"},\"book\":{\"id\":\"kca://book/amzn1.gr.book.v3.AZrVmBUlO9ey3o9t\"}}":{"__typename":"Shelving","creator":{"__ref":"User:kca://profile:goodreads/A3654WU95SBAAX","id":"kca://profile:goodreads/A3654WU95SBAAX"},"book":{"__ref":"Book:kca://book/amzn1.gr.book.v3.AZrVmBUlO9ey3o9t","id":"kca://book/amzn1.gr.book.v3.AZrVmBUlO9ey3o9t"},"shelf":{"__typename":"Shelf","name":"read","displayName":"Read","editable":false,"default":true,"actionType":"add_to_read","sortOrder":2,"webUrl":"https://www.goodreads.com/review/list/142072672?shelf=read"},"taggings":[],"webUrl":"https://www.goodreads.com/review/show/4361914553"},"Review:kca://review:goodreads/amzn1.gr.review:goodreads.v1.80neKdxxtsUrc9y7ztNrdw":{"__typename":"Review","id":"kca://review:goodreads/amzn1.gr.review:goodreads.v1.80neKdxxtsUrc9y7ztNrdw","creator":{"__ref":"User:142072672"},"recommendFor":null,"updatedAt":1776358224598,"createdAt":1655628043348,"spoilerStatus":false,"lastRevisionAt":1655659431247,"text":"\u003ci\u003e \"Lara, no matter where you are in the world, if you need me, I’ll come for you. Please know that.” \u003c/i\u003e \u003cbr /\u003e\u003cbr /\u003e*screams into a pillow* Wow that was intense. I had high expectations and the book delivered. \u003cbr /\u003e\u003cbr /\u003eThe Traitor Queen is an action packed book. The world building stays elite, and it's so brilliantly written. The characters are well developed and I couldn't keep this book down (well once I found my rhythm). There were some parts in the book that dragged on a bit longer than required, in my opinion but the story never loses its touch.\u003cbr /\u003e\u003cbr /\u003eAren and Lara had me screaming and crying. I was for real sweating throughout the ending. The tension is real. Those two are such an iconic couple, it's hard not to root for them. \u003cbr /\u003e\u003cbr /\u003eI liked Keris and Zarrah a lot, so am excited to see what the two have to offer in the next book. I'M SO EXCITED FOR IT!! \u003cbr /\u003e\u003cbr /\u003eIf only I could go back in time to a couple of days ago so I could read this series for the first time again 😭❤️","rating":4,"preReleaseBookSource":null,"shelving":{"__ref":"Shelving:{\"creator\":{\"id\":\"kca://profile:goodreads/A3654WU95SBAAX\"},\"book\":{\"id\":\"kca://book/amzn1.gr.book.v3.AZrVmBUlO9ey3o9t\"}}"},"likeCount":128,"viewerHasLiked":null,"commentCount":38},"User:160997715":{"__typename":"User","legacyId":160997715,"imageUrlSquare":"https://i.gr-assets.com/images/S/compressed.photo.goodreads.com/users/1770124881i/160997715._UX200_CR0,0,200,200_.jpg","isAuthor":false,"viewerRelationshipStatus":null,"followersCount":8322,"textReviewsCount":297,"name":"Laura Greenhalgh","webUrl":"https://www.goodreads.com/user/show/160997715-laura-greenhalgh","cont